 "remarks": "The one you've been waiting for! This Darien charmer has been renovated top to bottom. Gorgeous kitchen with custom cabinets? Check! All new appliances? Check! Two-zone high-efficiency HV/AC system with natural gas? Check! High-performance R30 attic insulation to lower energy costs? Check! Kitchen features gas cooking, a wine cooler, space for a coffee bar and built-in water filter. Renovated bathrooms along with refinished hardwood floors throughout, recessed lighting, and custom window treatments. Huge living room with gas fireplace, finished third floor place for an office or playroom, and a main-floor sunroom that leads to an expansive flagstone patio overlooking a private backyard. Two-car detached garage, walk to Glenbrook Train Station, and minutes to both Noroton Heights and downtown Darien shopping and restaurants. Top-rated Darien public schools. A true gem.",
